      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Gwen snips her scissors in a cone up to 6 times dealing magic damage. Gwen deals true damage to units in the center and applies her passive to them on each snip.",
      "summary_zh": "格温在一个锥形区域剪切她的剪刀至多6次，来造成魔法伤害。格温的每次剪切会对中心区域的敌人造成真实伤害并对它们施加她的被动技能。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1490084:4026398"
      ]
    },
