  "patch_change": {
    "source_ref_id": "source:riot-patch-notes:26.16",
    "status": "listed",
    "text_en": "Gwen Gwen has remained slightly weak since her nerfs earlier this year. We are buffing her passive sustain back up towards where it has previously been, which should help her be a powerful threat in some of her stronger matchups without making her feel uncounterable. Passive - A Thousand Cuts Healing On Champions : 50% post-mitigation, capped to 10-25 (based on level) (+6.5% AP) ⇒ 67% post-mitigation, capped to 12-40 (based on level) (+7% AP)"
  },
